   "source": [
    "## Conclusion\n",
    "\n",
    "- Trained a Decision Tree Regression model to predict house prices using 8 numerical features.\n",
    "- Handled missing values using median imputation.\n",
    "- Evaluated the model using MAE, RMSE, and R² Score.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Results\n",
    "\n",
    "- **MAE:** 321,566.26\n",
    "- **RMSE:** 496,136.12\n",
    "- **R² Score:** 0.3803\n",
    "\n",
    "### Comparison with Linear Regression\n",
    "\n",
    "The Decision Tree achieved a slightly lower MAE than Linear Regression, but its RMSE was higher and its R² Score was lower.\n",
    "\n",
    "Therefore, Linear Regression performed better overall on this test set based on RMSE and R².\n",
    "\n",
    "### Key Learning\n",
    "\n",
    "A more complex model does not always perform better. Model performance should be evaluated using multiple metrics and unseen test data.\n",
    "\n",
   ]
